Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 20:48:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?common,server:=20reasoning=20pressure=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20notice=20+=20squeeze=20steering=20(0010)?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

At start fraction of the reasoning budget a deterministic notice is
forced into the reasoning (FORCING_NOTA, returns to COUNTING); grace
tokens later a quadratic squeeze boosts only the matcher's next
end-token logit. Per-request via reasoning_pressure_* keys. clone()
now carries the full sampler state (fixes latent force_pos/remaining/
matcher-pos gaps). Spec: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-17-reasoning-pressure-design.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
